>\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2RegularSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2RegularSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}regular\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2RegularSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall C\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\land x\\notin C\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land C\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}regular\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2RegularSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall C\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,C)\\land x\\notin C\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land C\\subseteq V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file adopts the common <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_3\">\\(T_3\\)</span> convention: regularity includes Hausdorff separation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-top2-regular-space-—-ZFC-Top2-Regular-Space","text":"df-zfc-top2-regular-space — ZFC Top2 Regular Space","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":